I know some on this group despair of every YANI which is inspired by current Western culture. But, 
this YANI has great potential: Weeping Angel statues. This is inspired by Doctor Who's episode 
"Blink" which just aired in the US.

If the Weeping Angel touches you, the game is set back to turn 1 -- you just entered the dungeon. If 
in line of sight, the angel acts like a statue. Else, the statue moves 8-12 per turn by teleport.

Although this is rather severe, this is just a starting point for discussion. The concept has quite 
a few possibilities. If you did not see the episode, do so. Outstanding...


